1
00:00:48,479 --> 00:00:49,320
Chief

2
00:00:50,119 --> 00:00:51,679
We're already here.

3
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,200
Why the pause?

4
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,079
Still planning to lead the way?

5
00:00:55,079 --> 00:00:57,439
I, Zhang Tianyou, always finish what I start.

6
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:01,159
If some matters aren't resolved,

7
00:01:01,439 --> 00:01:02,799
I won't have peace even if I go inside.

8
00:01:02,799 --> 00:01:05,200
What else do you want to know?

9
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:08,879
When my father led the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family here back then,

10
00:01:08,879 --> 00:01:10,959
what exactly did they encounter in this tomb

11
00:01:11,359 --> 00:01:13,599
that got them completely wiped out?

12
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,200
They were attacked by evil creatures.

13
00:01:17,439 --> 00:01:20,599
The four great families fought desperately to escape with their lives.

14
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:22,680
How's that for an ending?

15
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:25,640
Since we share a bond forged in battle,

16
00:01:25,959 --> 00:01:27,439
then why are you pointing a gun at me now?

17
00:01:27,439 --> 00:01:29,359
Whatever old scores you want to settle,

18
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:32,000
now that the Tidal Tomb has been found,

19
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,200
your time as Chief is up.

20
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,319
Patriarch Mei,

21
00:01:35,319 --> 00:01:37,439
I went to great lengths to gather the Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye,

22
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:39,439
just to help us find this tomb

23
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:40,400
and open it.

24
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:43,560
But do you really know how to break through its traps?

25
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:49,319
Aren't you afraid the guys in this tomb

26
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:51,439
might follow you back to solve the mystery?

27
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:53,359
Don't try to bluff me again.

28
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:57,760
It's that thing!

29
00:01:57,959 --> 00:01:58,879
It's awake!

30
00:02:00,239 --> 00:02:01,200
Run!

31
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:02,840
After him!

32
00:02:20,319 --> 00:02:21,840
Sister Mei,

33
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:24,520
you said they'd definitely succeed,

34
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,280
right?

35
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:26,840
Sister Mei?

36
00:02:31,319 --> 00:02:32,439
Where are they?

37
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,879
They were just here.

38
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:40,520
Ling Yu!

39
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:41,479
You damn...

40
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:42,520
Let go!

41
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:43,560
Let go!

42
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:44,919
Let go!

43
00:02:44,919 --> 00:02:46,199
Let go of Ling Yu!

44
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,759
Ling Yu!

45
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,879
Ling Yu!

46
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,400
Ling Yu!

47
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,759
Ling Yu!

48
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:07,759
Qi Tianting!

49
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:09,840
Look at the state you're in now.

50
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,919
There's no point in living, is there?

51
00:03:12,439 --> 00:03:14,879
Let me put you out of your misery.

52
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:49,800
It's the unique token of the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family.

53
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,159
They all perished here.

54
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:56,719
These things could buy half the Shanghai Bund, right?

55
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:01,159
I'll just pocket some first.

56
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:02,400
Wait a minute.

57
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:10,479
These jewels are laced with a neurotoxin refined by ancient methods.

58
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:14,400
Touching it induces a feeling of extreme euphoria.

59
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,879
Until you finally die of exhaustion in that ecstasy.

60
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:22,079
Fenglin, there's a door here.

61
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,399
Once this curse is lifted,

62
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:51,800
this immense wealth will go to our Mei and Wan families.

63
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,839
Wealth is great,

64
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,439
but without Zhang Tianyou's help,

65
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,160
how do we break into the tomb and suppress the evil?

66
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:01,399
Don't worry, he won't get away.

67
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:03,879
When the time comes, with a gun to his head,

68
00:05:03,879 --> 00:05:05,160
he'll do it whether he wants to or not.

69
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:11,160
Fenglin, let's go.

70
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,759
Fenglin, come on!

71
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:17,879
Fenglin!

72
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:24,920
Mei Yuanhe!

73
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,959
What are you doing?

74
00:05:26,839 --> 00:05:28,240
I did it!

75
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,480
I am now the Shanghai Bund's...

76
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,519
Get lost!

77
00:05:32,319 --> 00:05:33,120
No...

78
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:35,120
I am Huaxia's...

79
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,600
I am the richest man in Huaxia!

80
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,319
Wan Fenglin!

81
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,240
You've gone mad!

82
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:48,000
Righteous power of heaven and earth, enter my body; Dragon-seeking spell, suppress the root of poison.

83
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,720
What exactly is going on here?

84
00:06:02,759 --> 00:06:04,959
The Celestial Seal, forged from meteorite iron,

85
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,279
has a crystal magnetic core at its center.

86
00:06:08,759 --> 00:06:10,360
It can disrupt biological magnetic fields.

87
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,240
The scent it emits

88
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,240
can even affect the activity of some venomous creatures.

89
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:15,240
That's also why

90
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,720
it can control the Mei family's Five Venomous Creatures.

91
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:18,560
That's amazing!

92
00:06:18,959 --> 00:06:19,759
Let me take a look.

93
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:22,759
This is a divine artifact from the heavens!

94
00:06:22,759 --> 00:06:23,600
So why did you think I

95
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:26,240
tried so hard to gather the Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye?

96
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,839
Without any one of them,

97
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:30,079
we wouldn't be able to get out of here alive.

98
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:30,560
Let's go.

99
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,000
Then what do the other two do?

100
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,319
They're passes to buy our way through.

101
00:06:35,319 --> 00:06:35,839
Hurry.

102
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:39,040
What a pity.

103
00:07:11,759 --> 00:07:13,160
Zhang Tianyou

104
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,759
Enemies are bound to cross paths.

105
00:07:14,759 --> 00:07:15,839
Go to hell!

106
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,160
Ling Yu, Chun'er!

107
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,319
Stay hidden and don't move!

108
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,800
This bastard treats you pretty well.

109
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,399
Jiushuang, you're familiar with the tomb's layout.

110
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,600
Take them back the way we came.

111
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:17,759
What about you?

112
00:08:18,079 --> 00:08:20,439
I need to handle the rest on my own.

113
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:21,240
Don't follow me.

114
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:23,079
Zhang Tianyou, I'm going with you.

115
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:23,720
Me too.

116
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,319
No.

117
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,920
Leng Feiyan's Sand-Turning Gang will meet you outside.

118
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,360
If you come with me,

119
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,439
you'll only be a burden.

120
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,240
and distract me.

121
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:33,799
Fine.

122
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:35,120
Then just stay out of this.

123
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:36,519
Then... can I go?

124
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:37,360
You can come along.

125
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:38,840
Let's go.

126
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:41,320
This is handy.

127
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:45,440
Let's go.

128
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,879
To see the true god,

129
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,919
an offering is required.

130
00:09:19,919 --> 00:09:21,679
Screw your offering!

131
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:22,440
Li Xiao.

132
00:09:24,279 --> 00:09:25,759
I suggest you calm down.

133
00:09:25,919 --> 00:09:28,879
These two seem to have quite a temper.

134
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:30,000
Bullshit!

135
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,360
What the hell are these things?

136
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:49,600
I already told you.

137
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,559
You didn't believe me.

138
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,679
Young Master, w-what...

139
00:09:51,679 --> 00:09:52,879
What is going on here?

140
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:54,759
These two are gatekeepers,

141
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:55,960
called Hanging Puppets.

142
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,399
Suspended by Heavenly Silkworm Thread,

143
00:09:57,519 --> 00:09:58,720
they are incredibly tough.

144
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:02,080
See the two grooves on the door?

145
00:10:02,799 --> 00:10:04,000
Those are two keyholes.

146
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,679
Brute force won't work.

147
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,240
We have to use this.

148
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,159
Would they even recognize this?

149
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:25,840
These two talisman books are made of special Yin-Yang Wood.

150
00:10:26,279 --> 00:10:29,039
Under special conditions, their wood pulp

151
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:31,480
can emit bioelectric waves.

152
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,720
Their ink is mixed with Meteorite Sand,

153
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,120
which has a weak magnetic field.

154
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:38,919
They're not meant to be read.

155
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,120
Move. Move aside.

156
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:47,759
They're used to match frequencies.

157
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:52,159
Just like the key to a safe.

158
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,080
Impossible.

159
00:11:07,799 --> 00:11:09,480
You can't be this powerful.

160
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,799
A pass to clear the way.

161
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,159
Get it now?

162
00:11:16,159 --> 00:11:18,799
Knowledge is the best key.

163
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:23,600
Violence only triggers more violent defense mechanisms.
